extends /template/newsentry.pug

block newsvariables
  - var newskey = '2012-03-27-contributions-to-geoinformatik-2012';

//-
  block date
    | [date]

  block title
    | [title]

block newscontent
  p.card-text
  p.
    Our Computer Graphics Systems working group at the Hasso-Plattner-Institut is contributing two papers and presentations to the GEOINFORMATIK 2012, which will be held in Braunschweig, on March 28-30, 2012. Mobility and environment are the two major topics of this year's conference.
    
  p
    | The first contribution is a paper on "
    a.external-link-new-window(href="http://www.hpi.uni-potsdam.de/doellner/publications/year/2012/2082/BD12.html" target="_blank" title="Öffnet externen Link in neuem Fenster") Dichte- und Distanzanalyse massiver raumzeitlicher Bewegungsdaten
    | " by Stefan Buschmann and Jürgen Döllner. A second paper is about "
    a.external-link-new-window(href="http://www.hpi.uni-potsdam.de/doellner/publications/year/2012/2078/RD12a.html" target="_blank" title="Öffnet externen Link in neuem Fenster") Potentiale von massiven 3D-Punktwolkendatenströmen
    | " by Rico Richter and Jürgen Döllner.
  
  p
    a.external-link-new-window(href="http://geoinformatik2012.de/" target="_blank" title="Öffnet externen Link in neuem Fenster") Link to the conference and program.
